{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"github--awesome-copilot--github-actions-hardening","name":"github-actions-hardening","description":"Security hardening reviewer for GitHub Actions workflow files (.github/workflows/*.yml). Reasons about the Actions threat model that pattern matchers and general code linters miss — untrusted-input script injection, privileged triggers running fork code, mutable action references, and over-scoped tokens. Use this skill when asked to review, audit, harden, or secure a GitHub Actions workflow, when writing a new workflow, or for any request like \"is this workflow safe?\", \"review my CI for security issues\", \"why is pull_request_target dangerous here?\", \"pin my actions\", or \"lock down GITHUB_TOKEN permissions\". Covers script injection via ${{ }} interpolation, pull_request_target / workflow_run privilege escalation, SHA-pinning of third-party actions, least-privilege permissions, GITHUB_ENV/GITHUB_OUTPUT injection, secret exposure, OIDC over long-lived credentials, and self-hosted runner exposure on public repositories.","category":"Security","tags":["github","actions","hardening","security","reviewer","workflow","files",".github","workflows",".yml","reasons","about","threat","model","pattern","matchers","general","code"],"repo":"github/awesome-copilot","owner":"github","stars":39345,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a","path":"skills/github-actions-hardening","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/tree/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/github-actions-hardening","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T01:29:08Z","fileCount":7,"bytes":24944,"sha256":"31a8e7483d978e6267941edefebbe42aaa946bb3d43c9095aa3db343d4a8ff06","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/github-actions-hardening/SKILL.md","bytes":9852,"sha256":"31a8e7483d978e6267941edefebbe42aaa946bb3d43c9095aa